de  bisected  with surrounding firm tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   1 intramammary lymph node  bisected   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Fibrous area surrounding biopsy cavity  lateral to medial   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue away from the biopsy site  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday REMOVED_MONTH 03   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05 53 17PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART   Breast  Right   Mastectomy  report_end  , Positive.
