 the superior and 0 5cm from the inferior aspect  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes A J with the cavity in cassettes A H and uninvolved fibrous tissue in cassettes I J  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final shave margins  is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm irregular tan yellow to pink unoriented portion of fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is serially sectioned to display a tan yellow to pink unremarkable cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes K R  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  SGR                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST LEFT  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN  EXCISION , Positive.
