presentative sections of the gritty nodule with margins are submitted in cassettes A D  Further representative sections of grossly uninvolved breast parenchyma are submitted in cassettes E F  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  1 o clock   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm portion of breast with a needle localization wire in place  The specimen is designated as follows  long   lateral  short   single  superior  double short   inferior  The specimen is inked as follows  posterior   deep black  anterior   blue  superior   red  inferior   yellow  Serial sectioning reveals homogenous yellow tan breast tissue with no discrete masses or lesions  The entire specimen is submitted in cassettes G N  from medial to lateral  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  final shave margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm portion of breast with a long suture designating the lateral margin  a short suture designating the inferior margin and double short suture designating the surface furthest from the tumor  The surface furthest from the tumor  true margin  is black inked  and then the superior end is red inked and the inferior end is blue inked for orientation  blue and red ink alone do not represent the true margin furthest from tumor   Serial sectioning reveals no lesions or areas of grittiness  Representative sections are submitted from lateral to medial in cassettes O X  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  bridge   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm portion of breast with a long suture designating the superior margin and a short suture designating the inferior margin  The superior margin is black inked  the inferior margin is blue inked  Serial sectioning reveals homogenous tan white breast tissue with no masses or lesions  The entire specimen is submitted in cassettes Y FF  Residen